==English==
{{wikipedia|Thanksgiving}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Thanksgiving]] [[day|Day]]}}

# {{Canada}} A [[holiday]], originally to give thanks to God for the harvest, celebrated annually on the second [[Monday]] of [[October]].
# {{US}} A [[holiday]], originally to give thanks to God and to [[commemorate]] the [[feast]] held by the [[Pilgrim]] [[colonist]]s, celebrated annually on the fourth [[Thursday]] of [[November]].

